  "alternateName": [
    "Health-RI Datacatalogus",
    "catalogus.healthdata.nl"
  ],
  "description": "Dutch national health research data catalogue built on the FAIR Data Point (FDP) specification. Metadata is described using HealthDCAT-AP, the European Health Data Space (EHDS) profile of DCAT-AP, making it one of the first national catalogs aligned with EHDS requirements. Harvests and exposes dataset metadata from hospitals, biobanks, research institutes, and cohort studies across the Netherlands. As of 2026, the catalogue indexes over 480 datasets. Metadata is openly accessible and FAIR-aligned; access to the underlying data is governed per dataset and is typically restricted.",
  "url": "https://catalogus.healthdata.nl/en",
  "dateModified": "2026-05-01",
